    schowana w sejfie.\",\"parentUIDs\":[146],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Sherlock\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":151}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":351.5,\"yPos\":1141},\"ID\":150,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Od
    rozmowy ze \u015Bwiadkami. Ka\u017Cdy z nich zna\u0142 Lady Edith w inny spos\xF3b.
    Ich zeznania mog\u0105 ujawni\u0107, komu zale\u017Ca\u0142o na jej \u015Bmierci.\",\"parentUIDs\":[149],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Sherlock\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":14},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":203}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":262.5,\"yPos\":1266},\"ID\":151,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Zatem
    porozmawiajmy z nimi, Holmes.\",\"parentUIDs\":[150],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Watson\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":156}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-458,\"yPos\":846},\"ID\":155,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Musimy
    przepyta\u0107 wszystkich \u015Bwiadk\xF3w zdarzenia. Ka\u017Cdy z nich zna\u0142
    Lady Edith w inny spos\xF3b. Ich zeznania mog\u0105 ujawni\u0107, komu zale\u017Ca\u0142o
    na jej \u015Bmierci.\",\"parentUIDs\":[2],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"`\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":14},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":203}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-468,\"yPos\":989},\"ID\":156,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Zatem
    porozmawiajmy z nimi, Holmes.\",\"parentUIDs\":[155],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Watson\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":159}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-202,\"yPos\":844},\"ID\":157,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Musimy
    dok\u0142adnie zbada\u0107 cia\u0142o ofiary. Przyjrzymy si\u0119 jej wsp\xF3lnie.
    Rana powinna powiedzie\u0107 nam wi\u0119cej o sposobie zab\xF3jstwa.\",\"parentUIDs\":[2],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Sherlock\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":14},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":203}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-196,\"yPos\":992},\"ID\":159,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Doskonale.
    Mo\u017Cesz liczy\u0107 na moj\u0105 pomoc, Holmes.\",\"parentUIDs\":[157],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Watson\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":162}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1129,\"yPos\":-674},\"ID\":161,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Musz\u0119
    dosta\u0107 si\u0119 na pi\u0119tro i odnale\u017A\u0107 ma\u0142\u0105 Ethel,
    Watsonie! Ale Selma nie odst\u0105pi od schod\xF3w.\\r\\n\",\"parentUIDs\":[160],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Sherlock\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":163}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1130,\"yPos\":-583},\"ID\":162,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Rozmawia\u0142em
    z Violet. By\u0107 mo\u017Ce uda mi si\u0119 przekona\u0107 j\u0105, aby poprosi\u0142a
    Selm\u0119 o jeszcze jeden seans, tym razem pr\xF3b\u0119 nawi\u0105zania kontaktu
    z ciotk\u0105 Edith.\",\"parentUIDs\":[161],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Watson\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1130,\"yPos\":-485},\"ID\":163,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"To
    mog\u0142oby odci\u0105gn\u0105\u0107 Selm\u0119 od schod\xF3w. Najpierw jednak
    musimy uruchomi\u0107 ten mechanizm, aby zwabi\u0107 tam sam\u0105 Violet.\",\"parentUIDs\":[162],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Sherlock\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":165}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1375,\"yPos\":-840},\"ID\":164,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Przyprowad\u017A
    Selm\u0119 do Salonu Watsonie, ja w tym czasie spr\xF3buje przekra\u015B\u0107
    si\u0119 na g\xF3r\u0119.\",\"parentUIDs\":[160],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Sherlock\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1407,\"yPos\":-688},\"ID\":165,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Oczywi\u015Bcie
    Holmes.\",\"parentUIDs\":[164],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Watson\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":172}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1477,\"yPos\":-377},\"ID\":170,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Wygl\u0105da
    na to, \u017Ce zostali\u015Bmy tu uwi\u0119zieni, Watsonie.\",\"parentUIDs\":[169],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Sherlock\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":175}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1661,\"yPos\":-483},\"ID\":172,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Nies\u0142ychane!
    Przecie\u017C nawet nie dotkn\u0105\u0142em tego manekina.\",\"parentUIDs\":[170],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Watson\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableBoolCondition:#DialogueEditor\",\"ParameterName\":\"BsSecretWall\",\"CheckType\":0,\"RequiredValue\":true}],\"NodeUID\":173},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableBoolCondition:#DialogueEditor\",\"ParameterName\":\"BrickWall\",\"CheckType\":0,\"RequiredValue\":true},{\"__type\":\"EditableBoolCondition:#DialogueEditor\",\"ParameterName\":\"BrickClock
    \",\"CheckType\":0,\"RequiredValue\":false}],\"NodeUID\":176},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableBoolCondition:#DialogueEditor\",\"ParameterName\":\"OldClock\",\"CheckType\":0,\"RequiredValue\":true}],\"NodeUID\":174},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":184},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableBoolCondition:#DialogueEditor\",\"ParameterName\":\"BrickClock
    \",\"CheckType\":0,\"RequiredValue\":false}],\"NodeUID\":188},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableBoolCondition:#DialogueEditor\",\"ParameterName\":\"ControlUnit\",\"CheckType\":0,\"RequiredValue\":true}],\"NodeUID\":177}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1918,\"yPos\":-396},\"ID\":175,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Kto\u015B
    celowo nas tutaj zamkn\u0105\u0142, przyjacielu. Musimy znale\u017A\u0107 spos\xF3b,
    by si\u0119 st\u0105d wydosta\u0107.\",\"parentUIDs\":[172],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Sherlock\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":179}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1705,\"yPos\":-916},\"ID\":178,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Nie
    wr\xF3c\u0119 na g\xF3r\u0119, p\xF3ki nie odnajdziemy Ethel. Potrzebujemy nie
    tyle wyj\u015Bcia, co drogi dalej.\",\"parentUIDs\":[173],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Sherlock\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":180}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1713,\"yPos\":-1033},\"ID\":179,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Masz
    jaki\u015B pomys\u0142?\",\"parentUIDs\":[178],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Watson\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":181}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1709,\"yPos\":-1165},\"ID\":180,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"\u015Aciana
    za skrzyniami skrywa jak\u0105\u015B tajemnic\u0119. Mo\u017Cliwe, \u017Ce jest
    te\u017C powi\u0105zana z manekinem.\",\"parentUIDs\":[179],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Sherlock\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":182},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":184}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1705,\"yPos\":-1307},\"ID\":181,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Zaraz
    odsun\u0119 te skrzynie, Holmes.\",\"parentUIDs\":[180],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Watson\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableBoolCondition:#DialogueEditor\",\"ParameterName\":\"BsSecretWall\",\"CheckType\":0,\"RequiredValue\":true}],\"NodeUID\":173},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableBoolCondition:#DialogueEditor\",\"ParameterName\":\"OldClock\",\"CheckType\":0,\"RequiredValue\":true}],\"NodeUID\":174},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableBoolCondition:#DialogueEditor\",\"ParameterName\":\"BrickWall\",\"CheckType\":0,\"RequiredValue\":true},{\"__type\":\"EditableBoolCondition:#DialogueEditor\",\"ParameterName\":\"BrickClock
    \",\"CheckType\":0,\"RequiredValue\":false}],\"NodeUID\":176},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":184}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1924,\"yPos\":-548},\"ID\":183,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Tak?\",\"parentUIDs\":[182,192],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Watson\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":186}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":2188,\"yPos\":-874},\"ID\":185,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Te
    ceg\u0142y w murze wyra\u017Anie odstaj\u0105 od pozosta\u0142ych.\",\"parentUIDs\":[176],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Sherlock\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":187}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":2183,\"yPos\":-981},\"ID\":186,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Mo\u017Ce
    kryje si\u0119 za nimi mechanizm steruj\u0105cy tym straszyd\u0142em, Holmes?\",\"parentUIDs\":[185],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Watson\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":182},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":184}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":2215,\"yPos\":-1171},\"ID\":187,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Bardzo
    mo\u017Cliwe, Watsonie. Musimy spr\xF3bowa\u0107 to rozpracowa\u0107.\",\"parentUIDs\":[186],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Sherlock\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":190}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1956,\"yPos\":-1196},\"ID\":189,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Tu\u017C
    przed zamkni\u0119ciem pu\u0142apki ten stary zegar wybi\u0142 jeden raz.\",\"parentUIDs\":[174],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Sherlock\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableBoolCondition:#DialogueEditor\",\"ParameterName\":\"BrickClock
    \",\"CheckType\":0,\"RequiredValue\":true}],\"NodeUID\":191},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":192},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":184}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1952,\"yPos\":-1324},\"ID\":190,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I
    w\u0142a\u015Bnie wtedy poruszy\u0142 si\u0119 manekin.\",\"parentUIDs\":[189],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Watson\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":194}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1956,\"yPos\":-1545},\"ID\":193,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Mo\u017Ce
    to zegar w \u015Bcianie jest po\u0142\u0105czony z manekinem...\",\"parentUIDs\":[191],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Sherlock\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1962,\"yPos\":-1659},\"ID\":194,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"...albo
    wszystko jest ze sob\u0105 po\u0142\u0105czone.\",\"parentUIDs\":[193],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Sherlock\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":197}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":2431,\"yPos\":-863},\"ID\":195,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Ten
    zegar wmurowany w \u015Bcian\u0119 musi by\u0107 kluczow\u0105 cz\u0119\u015Bci\u0105
    mechanizmu.\",\"parentUIDs\":[188],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Sherlock\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":198}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":2414,\"yPos\":-1011},\"ID\":197,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"My\u015Blisz,
    \u017Ce jest po\u0142\u0105czony z mechanizmem manekina?\",\"parentUIDs\":[195],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Watson\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":182}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":2426,\"yPos\":-1120},\"ID\":198,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Mo\u017Cliwe,
    \u017Ce wszystko jest tu ze sob\u0105 po\u0142\u0105czone, drogi Watsonie.\",\"parentUIDs\":[197],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Sherlock\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":201}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":2493,\"yPos\":-548},\"ID\":199,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"My\u015Blisz,
